    "### Understanding the Data\n",
    "\n",
    "This is sales data from a bookstore chain in 2024. Each row represents one book's sales for one month.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Columns:**\n",
    "- `month`: When the sales happened\n",
    "- `genre`: Type of book (Fiction, Non-Fiction, Mystery, Romance, Sci-Fi, Self-Help)\n",
    "- `title`: Book title\n",
    "- `author`: Who wrote it\n",
    "- `price`: Price in dollars\n",
    "- `units_sold`: How many copies sold\n",
    "- `revenue`: Total money made (price × units)\n",
    "- `region`: Where it sold (East, West, Central)\n",
    "- `rating`: Customer rating (1-5)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
